    {
      "flavor_text": "It nests in small, horizontal holes in cave walls.\nIt pounces to catch prey that stray too close.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "alpha-sapphire",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en el interior de cuevas, al amparo del calor\ngeotérmico. Si aun así sigue sintiendo frío, se\njunta con sus congéneres haciendo una piña.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It lives in caves warmed by geothermal heat.\nEven so, when the weather gets cold, it will\nhuddle close with others of its kind.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Permanece oculto en cuevas y cuando pasa una\npresa, se abalanza sobre ella y la muerde con\ntanta fuerza que hasta se le rompen los dientes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It skulks in caves, and when prey or an enemy\npasses by, it leaps out and chomps them. The\nforce of its attack sometimes chips its teeth.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En cuanto percibe un objeto en movimiento, se\nlanza contra él y le asesta dentelladas. A veces\nse hiere a sí mismo, pero no le importa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It reacts to anything that moves—flies right at it\nand bites it. Sometimes it injures itself, but it\ndoesn’t care too much.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon habituado a un clima aún más\ncálido que el de Alola. Quien convive con un\nGible gasta mucho dinero en calefacción.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its original home is an area much hotter than\nAlola. If you’re planning to live with one, your\nheating bill will soar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vive en pequeños agujeros de cuevas calentadas\npor la energía geotérmica, por lo que no pasa\nfrío ni aunque fuera se desate una ventisca.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gible prefers to stay in narrow holes in the sides\nof caves heated by geothermal energy. This way,\nGible can stay warm even during a blizzard.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ataca indiscriminadamente a cualquier cosa que\nse mueva y la arrastra a su agujero. Pese a tener\nuna boca enorme, su estómago es pequeño.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gible attacks anything that moves, and it drags\nwhatever it catches into the crevice that is its lair.\nDespite the big mouth, Gible’s stomach is small.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It nests in caves untouched by sunlight. Its sharp teeth may fall\nout when worn away or after an impact, but they regrow within\na few days.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    }
